s Rin to face a terrible truth—the blood of the demon lord Satan runs in Rin’s veins! Rin swears to defeat Satan, but doing that means entering the mysterious True Cross Academy and becoming an exorcist himself. Can Rin fight demons and keep his infernal bloodline a secret? It won't be easy, especially when drawing his father's sword releases the demonic power within him!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kato Kazue\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421540320\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 202\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390169211033,"sku":"Manga-A-3-9781421540320","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68246ac8173d2_Blue_Exorcist__Vol._1__1___1.jpg?v=1747231165"},{"product_id":"hyde-closer-vol-4-4","title":"Hyde \u0026 Closer, Vol. 4 (4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe magic journey of a boy and his chain saw-wielding bear!Shunpei Closer is your average...well, slightly below average kid in junior high who finds himself in the middle of a great battle of dark sorcery. With cursed dolls coming after him one after another, Shunpei Closer's life is in danger! If that weren't enough, Hyde, the teddy bear given to him by his grandfather, suddenly comes alive to rescue him. With Hyde's help, can Shunpei save himself and live to see another day?A reformed hoodlum is powerless to stop an unscrupulous sorcerer who can break his opponent's bones with a chance roll of a die. But should a guardian angel happen to appear with a chainsaw in hand, maybe luck will be on his side…\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Haro Aso\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421534275\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390169899161,"sku":"Manga-A-4-9781421534275","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68246b527f216-Hyde-Closer-Vol-4-4-1-_1.jpg?v=1748277370"},{"product_id":"hyde-closer-vol-5-5","title":"Hyde \u0026 Closer, Vol. 5 (5)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe magic journey of a boy and his chain saw-wielding bear!Shunpei Closer is your average...well, slightly below average kid in junior high who finds himself in the middle of a great battle of dark sorcery. With cursed dolls coming after him one after another, Shunpei Closer's life is in danger! If that weren't enough, Hyde, the teddy bear given to him by his grandfather, suddenly comes alive to rescue him. With Hyde's help, can Shunpei save himself and live to see another day?Shunpei's facing his biggest threat yet—a mob of 100 sorcerers who have no qualms about hurting anyone that gets in their way. But with Hyde out of the picture, has Shunpei completely given up the fight…?!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Haro Aso\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421534923\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390169931929,"sku":"Manga-A-4-9781421534923","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68246b646ecaa_Hyde___Closer__Vol._5.jpg?v=1747231178"},{"product_id":"kare-kano-his-and-her-circumstances-vol-20","title":"Kare Kano: His and Her Circumstances, Vol. 20","description":"\u003cp\u003eAfter Soichiro threatens Yukino's status as most popular, Yukino tries to regain her idol-like popularity, struggling with her own inner problems while they develop a unique relationship.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 121 x 184\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Masami Tsuda\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781598161830\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390170914969,"sku":"Manga-A-19781598161830","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68246b9fa61de_Kare_Kano_His_and_Her_Circumstances__Vol._20.jpg?v=1747231184"},{"product_id":"my-hero-academia-vol-7-7","title":"My Hero Academia, Vol. 7 (7)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMidoriya inherits the superpower of the world’s greatest hero, but greatness won’t come easy.What would the world be like if 80 percent of the population manifested superpowers called “Quirks”? Heroes and villains would be battling it out everywhere! Being a hero would mean learning to use your power, but where would you go to study? The Hero Academy of course! But what would you do if you were one of the 20 percent who were born Quirkless?Midoriya has learned a few tricks from Gran Torino, but some things just have to be experienced to be understood. Even though he’s not ready, when the League of Villains attacks in the town of Hosu, Midoriya rushes to help Ida, who is engaged in a life-and-death struggle with Hero Killer Stain. Stain has some very particular ideas about heroes and their place in society—and he means to purge the world of every hero he can find!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kohei Horikoshi\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421590400\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390171144345,"sku":"Manga-A-3-9781421590400","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6824746e4a307-My-Hero-Academia-Vol-7-7-_1.jpg?v=1748277359"},{"product_id":"seduction-more-beautiful-than-love-volume-1","title":"Seduction More Beautiful Than Love Volume 1","description":"\u003cp\u003eDaoun Jung, the new teacher at school, must handle an unresponsive, stubborn high school class, her coworker Hyunwoo's crush, and the seductive plans of her trouble student, Ryumin.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 184\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Lee Hyun-Sook\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781427806086\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390171635865,"sku":"Manga-A-19781427806086","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/682474af33e84_Seduction_More_Beautiful_Than_Love_Volume_1.jpg?v=1747231200"},{"product_id":"tegami-bachi-vol-13-13","title":"Tegami Bachi, Vol. 13 (13)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA New York Times best-selling sci-fi fantasy series with heart.Amberground is locked in darkness. A man-made star casts only a dim light over the land. The pitch-black wilderness is infested with Gaichuu—colossal insects with metal exoskeletons. The Gaichuu make travel between the cities of Amberground extremely dangerous. But thankfully the Letter Bees, a brave corps of messengers, risk their lives in order to keep the hearts of Amberground connected.While Lag and his fellow Bees fight a desperate battle against the Gaichuu Cabernet, the dark secrets of Amberground come to light. What unspeakable things did Garrard, director of the Beehive, see in Amberground’s capital? And why has former director Largo Lloyd joined the rebel organization Reverse? The answers lie in the top-secret district called Kagerou…\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Asada | Hiroyuki\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421551593\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390171668633,"sku":"Manga-A-19781421551593","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/682474d88141e-TEGAMI-BACHI-VOL13-_1.jpg?v=1748277353"},{"product_id":"the-rising-of-the-shield-hero-volume-03-the-rising-of-the-shield-hero-series-light-novel","title":"The Rising of the Shield Hero Volume 03 (The Rising of the Shield Hero Series: Light Novel)","description":"\u003cp\u003eNaofumi Iwatani, an uncharismatic Otaku who spends his days on games and manga, suddenly finds himself summoned to a parallel universe! He discovers he is one of four heroes equipped with legendary weapons and tasked with saving the world from its prophesied destruction. As the Shield Hero, the weakest of the heroes, all is not as it seems. Naofumi is soon alone, penniless, and betrayed. With no one to turn to, and nowhere to run, he is left with only his shield. Now, Naofumi must rise to become the legendary Shield Hero and save the world!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 178\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Aneko Yusagi\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781935548669\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 344\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390172848281,"sku":"Manga-A-19781935548669","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6824751664008-The-Rising-of-the-Shield-Hero-Volume-03-The-Rising-of-the-Shield-Hero-Series-Light_1100_1.jpg?v=1748277347"}],"url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/collections\/comics-manga.oembed?page=7","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}